# Corpus rules for the graphify knowledge graph.
#
# The graph is the agent's first stop for any question about this codebase, so
# what it holds has to be worth answering from. Source, tests, docs pages, and
# the design rationale under .claude/plans/ideas|specs all qualify. Finished
# working output from a past agent run does not: it is a snapshot of a codebase
# that has since moved, it is never revised, and because it is the only place in
# the corpus written partly in Russian, a Russian question lands in it by
# accident instead of in the code it is asking about.
.claude/plans/reports/
